</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"androidx.core.content.FileProvider\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            android:authorities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"${applicationId}.provider\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            android:exported</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"false\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            android:grantUriPermissions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">meta-data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.support.FILE_PROVIDER_PATHS\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                android:resource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@xml/file_paths\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">provider</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">application</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">manifest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;manifest&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;uses-permission&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;uses-feature&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;application&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;activity&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;service&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;receiver&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; H[&quot;provider&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; I[&quot;intent-filter&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; J[&quot;intent-filter&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; K[&quot;meta-data&quot;]&#10;&#10;    classDef rootStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    classDef componentStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A rootStyle&#10;    class E,F,G,H componentStyle\">graph TD\n    A[\"manifest\"] --&gt; B[\"uses-permission\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"uses-feature\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"application\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"activity\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"service\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"receiver\"]\n    D --&gt; H[\"provider\"]\n    E --&gt; I[\"intent-filter\"]\n    G --&gt; J[\"intent-filter\"]\n    D --&gt; K[\"meta-data\"]\n\n    classDef rootStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef componentStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A rootStyle\n    class E,F,G,H componentStyle</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"权限声明\">权限声明</h2><p>Android 权限分为普通权限和危险权限。普通权限在安装时自动授予，危险权限需要运行时请求。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>权限类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>授予方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>普通权限</td>\n<td>对用户隐私影响较小</td>\n<td><code>INTERNET</code>、<code>VIBRATE</code></td>\n<td>安装时自动授予</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>危险权限</td>\n<td>涉及敏感数据或功能</td>\n<td><code>CAMERA</code>、<code>LOCATION</code>、<code>CONTACTS</code></td>\n<td>运行时请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>特殊权限</td>\n<td>系统级敏感操作</td>\n<td><code>SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW</code></td>\n<td>需跳转设置页</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>运行时权限请求的 Kotlin 实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class CameraActivity : ComponentActivity() {&#10;&#10;    private val cameraPermissionLauncher = registerForActivityResult(&#10;        ActivityResultContracts.RequestPermission()&#10;    ) { isGranted -&gt;&#10;        if (isGranted) {&#10;            openCamera()&#10;        } else {&#10;            showPermissionDeniedDialog()&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private fun requestCameraPermission() {&#10;        when {&#10;            checkSelfPermission(Manifest.permission.CAMERA) ==&#10;                PackageManager.PERMISSION_GRANTED -&gt; {&#10;                openCamera()&#10;            }&#10;            shouldShowRequestPermissionRationale(Manifest.permission.CAMERA) -&gt; {&#10;                showRationaleDialog {&#10;                    cameraPermissionLauncher.launch(Manifest.permission.CAMERA)&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;            else -&gt; {&#10;                cameraPermissionLauncher.launch(Manifest.permission.CAMERA)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class CameraActivity : ComponentActivity() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val cameraPermissionLauncher = registerForActivityResult(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ActivityResultContracts.RequestPermission()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) { isGranted -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (isGranted) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            openCamera()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            showPermissionDeniedDialog()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private fun requestCameraPermission() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        when {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            checkSelfPermission(Manifest.permission.CAMERA) ==</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                PackageManager.PERMISSION_GRANTED -> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                openCamera()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            shouldShowRequestPermissionRationale(Manifest.permission.CAMERA) -> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                showRationaleDialog {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    cameraPermissionLauncher.launch(Manifest.permission.CAMERA)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            else -> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                cameraPermissionLauncher.launch(Manifest.permission.CAMERA)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 在 Jetpack Compose 中，可以使用 <code>accompanist-permissions</code> 库简化权限请求流程。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"intent-filter\">Intent Filter</h2><p>Intent Filter 声明组件能够响应的 Intent 类型，是 Android 组件间通信的核心机制。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 在 Compose 中处理 deep link&#10;@Composable&#10;fun AppNavigation() {&#10;    val navController = rememberNavController()&#10;&#10;    NavHost(navController = navController, startDestination = &quot;home&quot;) {&#10;        composable(&quot;home&quot;) { HomeScreen() }&#10;        composable(&#10;            route = &quot;product/{id}&quot;,&#10;            deepLinks = listOf(&#10;                navDeepLink { uriPattern = &quot;https://example.com/product/{id}&quot; }&#10;            )&#10;        ) { backStackEntry -&gt;&#10;            val productId = backStackEntry.arguments?.getString(&quot;id&quot;)&#10;            ProductScreen(productId = productId)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 Compose 中处理 deep link</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AppNavigation() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val navController = rememberNavController()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    NavHost(navController = navController, startDestination = \"home\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable(\"home\") { HomeScreen() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        composable(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            route = \"product/{id}\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            deepLinks = listOf(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                navDeepLink { uriPattern = \"https://example.com/product/{id}\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) { backStackEntry -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val productId = backStackEntry.arguments?.getString(\"id\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ProductScreen(productId = productId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>清单中的 Intent Filter 配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;activity&#10;    android:name=&quot;.DeepLinkActivity&quot;&#10;    android:exported=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&#10;    &lt;intent-filter android:autoVerify=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&#10;        &lt;action android:name=&quot;android.intent.action.VIEW&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;category android:name=&quot;android.intent.category.DEFAULT&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;category android:name=&quot;android.intent.category.BROWSABLE&quot; /&gt;&#10;        &lt;data&#10;            android:scheme=&quot;https&quot;&#10;            android:host=&quot;example.com&quot;&#10;            android:pathPrefix=&quot;/product&quot; /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/intent-filter&gt;&#10;&lt;/activity&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">activity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".DeepLinkActivity\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:exported</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">intent-filter</span><span style=\"color:#6F