\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            android:host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"example.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            android:pathPrefix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/product\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">intent-filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">activity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant 浏览器&#10;    participant 系统&#10;    participant 清单&#10;    participant Activity&#10;&#10;    浏览器-&gt;&gt;系统: 点击链接 https://example.com/product/123&#10;    系统-&gt;&gt;清单: 匹配 intent-filter&#10;    清单--&gt;&gt;系统: DeepLinkActivity 匹配成功&#10;    系统-&gt;&gt;Activity: 启动 Activity,传递 Intent&#10;    Activity-&gt;&gt;Activity: 解析 URI 获取 productId=123\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant 浏览器\n    participant 系统\n    participant 清单\n    participant Activity\n\n    浏览器-&gt;&gt;系统: 点击链接 https://example.com/product/123\n    系统-&gt;&gt;清单: 匹配 intent-filter\n    清单--&gt;&gt;系统: DeepLinkActivity 匹配成功\n    系统-&gt;&gt;Activity: 启动 Activity,传递 Intent\n    Activity-&gt;&gt;Activity: 解析 URI 获取 productId=123</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"组件声明\">组件声明</h2><p>清单中必须声明应用的所有四大组件，未声明的组件无法被系统识别和启动。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>标签</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>关键属性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Activity</td>\n<td><code>&lt;activity&gt;</code></td>\n<td>用户界面</td>\n<td><code>exported</code>、<code>launchMode</code>、<code>screenOrientation</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Service</td>\n<td><code>&lt;service&gt;</code></td>\n<td>后台任务</td>\n<td><code>exported</code>、<code>foregroundServiceType</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BroadcastReceiver</td>\n<td><code>&lt;receiver&gt;</code></td>\n<td>系统事件监听</td>\n<td><code>exported</code>、<code>enabled</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ContentProvider</td>\n<td><code>&lt;provider&gt;</code></td>\n<td>数据共享</td>\n<td><code>authorities</code>、<code>exported</code>、<code>grantUriPermissions</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 前台服务声明（Android 14+ 必须指定类型） --&gt;&#10;&lt;uses-permission android:name=&quot;android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;uses-permission android:name=&quot;android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_LOCATION&quot; /&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;service&#10;    android:name=&quot;.tracking.LocationTrackingService&quot;&#10;    android:foregroundServiceType=&quot;location&quot;&#10;    android:exported=&quot;false&quot; /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 前台服务声明（Android 14+ 必须指定类型） --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses-permission</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses-permission</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_LOCATION\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".tracking.LocationTrackingService\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:foregroundServiceType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"location\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:exported</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"false\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 从 Android 12 开始，所有包含 Intent Filter 的组件必须显式设置 <code>android:exported</code> 属性，否则应用无法安装。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"构建变体与清单合并\">构建变体与清单合并</h2><p>多模块项目和不同构建变体会产生多个清单文件，最终由 Gradle 合并为一个。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[主模块清单 main] --&gt; D[合并后的清单]&#10;    B[库模块清单 library] --&gt; D&#10;    C[构建变体清单 debug/release] --&gt; D&#10;    E[依赖库清单 third-party] --&gt; D&#10;&#10;    classDef mergeStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class D mergeStyle\">graph LR\n    A[主模块清单 main] --&gt; D[合并后的清单]\n    B[库模块清单 library] --&gt; D\n    C[构建变体清单 debug/release] --&gt; D\n    E[依赖库清单 third-party] --&gt; D\n\n    classDef mergeStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class D mergeStyle</pre><p>清单合并规则和冲突解决：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"xml\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 使用 tools:replace 解决属性冲突 --&gt;&#10;&lt;application&#10;    android:icon=&quot;@mipmap/ic_launcher&quot;&#10;    tools:replace=&quot;android:icon&quot;&gt;&#10;&lt;/application&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 使用 tools:remove 移除不需要的权限（来自第三方库） --&gt;&#10;&lt;uses-permission&#10;    android:name=&quot;android.permission.ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION&quot;&#10;    tools:node=&quot;remove&quot; /&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 使用 tools:node=&quot;merge&quot; 控制合并策略 --&gt;&#10;&lt;activity&#10;    android:name=&quot;.MainActivity&quot;&#10;    tools:node=&quot;merge&quot; /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 使用 tools:replace 解决属性冲突 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">application</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:icon</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@mipmap/ic_launcher\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    tools:replace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android:icon\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">application</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 使用 tools:remove 移除不需要的权限（来自第三方库） --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses-permission</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"android.permission.ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    tools:node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"remove\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 使用 tools:node=\"merge\" 控制合并策略 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">activity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    android:name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".MainActivity\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    tools:node</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"merge\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span></code></pre></div><p>构建变体对应的清单路径：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"app/src/&#10;├── main/AndroidManifest.xml       # 主清单&#10;├── debug/AndroidManifest.xml      # debug 特有配置&#10;├── release/AndroidManifest.xml    # release 特有配置&#10;└── staging/AndroidManifest.xml    # 自定义变体配置\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>app/src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── main/AndroidManifest.xml       # 主清单</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── debug/AndroidManifest.xml      # debug 特有配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── release/AndroidManifest.xml    # release 特有配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── staging/AndroidManifest.xml    # 自定义变体配置</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>AndroidManifest.xml</code> 是应用的核心配置文件，声明组件、权限和硬件需求</li>\n<li>权限分为普通权限、危险权限和特殊权限，危险权限必须在运行时动态请求</li>\n<li>Intent Filter 定义组件响应的 Intent 类型，支持 Deep Link 和应用间通信</li>\n<li>四大组件（Activity、Service、Receiver、Provider）必须在清单中声明</li>\n<li>多模块和多变体场景下，Gradle 会自动合并清单文件，使用 <code>tools:*</code> 属性解决冲突</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"应用清单","id":"应用清单"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"AndroidManifest.xml 结构","id":"androidmanifest-xml-结构"},{"level":2,"text":"权限声明","id":"权限声明"},{"level":2,"text":"Intent Filter","id":"intent-filter"},{"level":2,"text":"组件声明","id":"组件声明"},{"level":2,"text":"构建变体与清单合并","id":"构建变体与清单合并"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Fragment 生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/fundamentals/fragment-lifecycle"},"next":{"title":"Compose 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/jetpack-compose/compose-fundamentals"}}